 "intro": {
  "@es": "En una conversación real no solo importa lo que dices, sino cómo reaccionas: si dudas, si estás de acuerdo, si no te lo crees. El italiano tiene palabras cortas para todo eso.",
  "@en": "In a real conversation, not only does it matter what you say, but how you react: if you doubt, if you agree, if you don't believe it. The Italian has short words for all that."
